\pard\keepn\sa300\sb80\cf1\b\f1\fs36 PubPlay Guide for Pub Owners and Staff\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 PubPlay runs a complete pub games night across three screens:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab The \b host tablet\b0  controls registration, fixtures, scores and the archive.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab The \b TV display\b0  shows the join code, next fixtures and live standings.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab \b Players' phones\b0  are used to join and follow fixtures and results. Players do not install an app.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 Before the First Games Night\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Prepare:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab An Android tablet with PubPlay installed from Google Play.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Reliable internet for the tablet. Pub Wi-Fi or a mobile hotspot is suitable.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab A TV with a web browser, Android TV, Fire TV, streaming stick, laptop or other browser-connected device.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab A Google Play account for purchasing or restoring the venue subscription.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab The referral code supplied by the PubPlay partner, if applicable.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 On the tablet:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 1.\tab Open \b PubPlay Tablet\b0 .\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 2.\tab Select \b Create owner account\b0 .\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 3.\tab Enter the owner's name, business email and a secure password.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 4.\tab Sign in and complete \b Venue setup\b0 .\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 5.\tab Enter the pub's real name, postcode and city.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 6.\tab Enter the partner referral code before selecting \b Create pub account\b0 .\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 7.\tab Open \b Subscription\b0 , load the available plans and select monthly or annual.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 8.\tab Complete the Google Play purchase. The monthly plan includes the trial shown by Google Play when eligible.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 9.\tab Wait until the subscription section confirms that access is active.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 The owner account and venue restore automatically when the app is reopened. Keep the password private and do not share the Google reviewer access code.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 Quick Checklist for Every Games Night\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 1.\tab Connect the tablet to the internet and open PubPlay.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 2.\tab Confirm the correct venue and active subscription.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 3.\tab Select the game and tournament format.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 4.\tab Enter a clear event name and select \b Create games night\b0 .\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 5.\tab Open the TV display and show the player QR code.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 6.\tab Wait for every player or team to join.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 7.\tab Correct names and teams before creating fixtures.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 8.\tab Close registration and create fixtures.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 9.\tab Enter every result on the tablet.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 10.\tab Advance each knockout round when required.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 11.\tab Select \b Finish event\b0 , check the final result and then archive it.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 Creating a Games Night\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 In the \b Games night\b0  section:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 1.\tab Select a game such as darts, pool, quiz, bingo, dominoes, cribbage, skittles, shuffleboard or table football.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 2.\tab Select \b Custom game\b0  if the pub wants to supply another game name.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 3.\tab Choose the tournament format:\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1    - \b Individual round robin:\b0  every player plays every other player.\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1    - \b Team round robin:\b0  every team plays every other team.\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1    - \b Knockout tournament:\b0  the winner of each match advances until the final.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 4.\tab Enter an event name, for example \f2\highlight2 Friday Darts - 31 July\highlight0\f0 .\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 5.\tab Select \b Create games night\b0 .\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Only one active games night can exist for a venue. Finish and archive it before starting another one.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 If an event was created by mistake, \b Cancel empty event\b0  is available only while registration is open and no players have joined.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 Connecting the TV\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 The TV is a separate live display; the tablet remains available to the host.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 1.\tab On the tablet, select \b Open TV display setup\b0 .\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 2.\tab On the TV device, either:\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1    - scan the TV QR code with the TV/streaming device where supported; or\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1    - type the displayed TV address into its web browser.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 3.\tab Put the browser into full-screen mode.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 4.\tab Keep the TV browser open for the duration of the event.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 During registration, the TV shows the join code and checked-in player count. During play, it shows the next fixture, latest result and top standings. It refreshes automatically.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 The host tablet does not need an HDMI connection. The tablet and TV only need internet access; they may use the same Wi-Fi or different connections.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 How Players Join on Their Phones\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Tell players:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 1.\tab Open the phone camera and scan the player QR code shown on the tablet.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 2.\tab If scanning is unavailable, open \f2\highlight2 https://play.backendkz.co.in\highlight0\f0  and enter the join code.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 3.\tab Check that the pub name and games-night name are correct.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 4.\tab Enter a recognisable player name.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 5.\tab For a team event, enter the agreed team name exactly. The team name is required.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 6.\tab Select \b Join games night\b0  once.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 7.\tab Wait for \b You are checked in\b0 .\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 No app installation or player account is required. The phone remembers that player's check-in in the same browser. Players should not use private/incognito mode or clear browser data during the event.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 After fixtures are created, each phone shows relevant fixtures, all players and the live leaderboard. Players view results on their phones; the host enters the official score on the tablet.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 Checking Players and Closing Registration\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 The \b Players and fixtures\b0  section updates automatically.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Before closing registration:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Confirm that every participant appears.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Remove accidental registrations before fixtures are created.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Use \b Rename\b0  to correct a player's name.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab For team events, ensure every player has the correct team name.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Ask late players to join now. No new registrations are accepted after fixtures are created.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Then select the appropriate button:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab \b Close registration and create round-robin fixtures\b0 \par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab \b Close registration and create team fixtures\b0 \par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab \b Close registration and create knockout bracket\b0 \par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Confirm the prompt. Registration closes immediately and fixtures are generated.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 Recording Scores\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 For each completed match:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 1.\tab Find the match under \b Players and fixtures\b0 .\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 2.\tab Enter the score for both sides.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 3.\tab Check that the values are assigned to the correct players or teams.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 4.\tab Select \b Save result\b0 .\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 The player phones, tablet leaderboard and TV update automatically. A saved score can be corrected with \b Update\b0  while the event is still in progress. Finished and archived events are read-only.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 PubPlay awards leaderboard points from completed results. No leader is shown before the first score is recorded.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 Knockout Tournaments\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 For a knockout event:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 1.\tab Record every result in the current round.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 2.\tab Confirm there are no missing scores.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 3.\tab Select \b Advance knockout round\b0 .\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 4.\tab Repeat until the final consists of one completed match.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 5.\tab Select \b Finish event\b0 .\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 The advance button remains unavailable until every match in the current round is complete. Byes are handled by the bracket.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 Finishing and Archiving\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 When every fixture has a result:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 1.\tab Select \b Finish event\b0 .\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 2.\tab Confirm the final leaderboard and winner.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 3.\tab Results become read-only.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720 4.\tab Select \b Archive completed event\b0 .\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 To view old events, select \b Event archive\b0  in the tablet header. An archived event contains:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab the final leaderboard;\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab player and team names;\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab every fixture and result;\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab the winner;\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab a final-results QR code that players can scan later.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Return to \b Host view\b0  before creating the next games night.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 Subscription and Account Tasks\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Use \b Refresh subscription\b0  after a new purchase if activation is not immediate.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Use \b Restore Google Play purchase\b0  after reinstalling PubPlay or changing tablet.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab The active plan and app version appear in the Subscription section.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Sign out only when changing owner account or handing the tablet to another business.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Do not create a second venue to solve a login or subscription problem; contact support first.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 Troubleshooting\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 ### A player does not appear\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Check that the phone displays \b You are checked in\b0 . Confirm the tablet has internet, wait five seconds and select \b Refresh\b0 . If registration is closed, the event cannot accept another player.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 ### The QR code does not scan\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Increase tablet brightness, clean the camera lens or ask the player to enter the visible join code at \f2\highlight2 https://play.backendkz.co.in\highlight0\f0 .\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 ### The TV says Display unavailable or Reconnecting\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Check the TV's internet connection and verify the full address shown in \b TV display setup\b0 . Reload the browser. Score entry can continue on the tablet while the TV reconnects.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 ### The subscription appears inactive\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Confirm the tablet uses the Google account that made the purchase. Select \b Restore Google Play purchase\b0 , then \b Refresh subscription\b0 . Do not buy the same plan twice.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 ### A score was entered incorrectly\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Select \b Update\b0  beside the fixture before finishing the event. Scores cannot be changed after the event is finished or archived.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 ### The host cannot create another event\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Open the current event. Complete all fixtures, finish it and archive it. Only one unfinished games night is allowed per venue.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\keepn\sa150\sb260\cf1\b\f1\fs27 Safe Operation\b0\cf0\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Use a unique owner password and keep the tablet screen locked when unattended.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Do not display owner credentials, referral codes or Google reviewer credentials.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Collect only the player names needed to run the event.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Ask players to use a nickname if they do not want their full name displayed.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Keep the tablet charged and have a charger available near the host position.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa80\tx720\bullet\tab Record any problem, its time, event name and a screenshot before contacting support.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Support contact: \b info@fullstackdev.kz\b0 \par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sa80\par
}
